id: K8S-032
ilities: [integrity]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: warn
title: Deployment missing NetworkPolicy
category: security
severity: info
engine: absence
target:
  extensions: .yaml .yml
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: kind: Deployment
patterns:
  - regex: NetworkPolicy
    message: "No NetworkPolicy — all pods can communicate with all other pods by default"
fix: Create NetworkPolicy resources to restrict ingress/egress traffic. Default-deny with explicit allow is the safest approach.
